<title>USA: New York grain freight fixtures - Nov 19.</title>
<headline>New York grain freight fixtures - Nov 19.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>TBN 54,000 5% long tons hss USG/Japan 5-15/12 $23.00 fio 11 days Hanjin (adds charterer).</p>
<p>Min Noble 54,000 5% long tons hss Nopac/Taiwan 1-10/12 $16,80 fio 11 days MSK.</p>
<p>L. Polskie 52,000 5% long tons hss NoPac/Japan 1-10/12 $16.00 fio 11 days Dreyfus.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities Desk +1 212 859 1640</p>
